"uvesti v :p rogram:'Krita'. Moč te skupine je, da delijo veliko informacij "
"med seboj, kot so nasveti in triki in vaje."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_readme.rst:286
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Professionals, people who earn their money with digital drawing software. "
"The strength of this group is that they have a lot of know-how and are "
"willing to donate to improve the program. These come in two types:"
msgstr ""
"Profesionalci, ljudje, ki zaslužijo svoj denar s programsko opremo za "
"digitalno risanje. Moč te skupine je, da imajo veliko know-how in so "
