"besedilo."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_readme.rst:315
#, fuzzy
msgid "Regarding photos and paintings"
msgstr "Glede fotografij in slik"

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_readme.rst:317
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We would like to discourage photos and traditional paintings in the manual "
"if they are not illustrating a concept. The reason is that it is very silly "
"and a little dishonest to show Rembrandt's work inside the Krita GUI, when "
"we have so many modern works that were made in Krita. All of the "
"Pepper&Carrot artwork was made in Krita and the original files are "
"available, so when you do not have an image handy, start there. Photos "
"should be avoided because Krita is a painting program. Too many photos can "
"give the impression Krita is trying to be a solution for photo retouching, "
"which really isn't the focus."
msgstr ""
"Fotografije in tradicionalne slike bi radi odvračali v priročniku, če ne "
"ponazarjajo koncepta. Razlog je, da je zelo trapasto in malo neispravno "
"pokazati Rembrandtova dela znotraj Krita GUI, ko imamo toliko sodobnih del, "
"ki so bila narejena v Kriti. Vsa umetnina Pepper&Carrot je bila narejena v "
"Kriti in originalne datoteke so na voljo, tako da ko nimaš slike priročno, "
"začnite tam. Fotografijam se je treba izogniti, ker je Krita slikarski "
"program. Preveč fotografij lahko da vtis Krita poskuša biti rešitev za "
"retuširanje fotografij, kar res ni fokus."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_readme.rst:318
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Of course, we still want to show certain concepts in play in photos and "
"master paintings, such as glossing or indirect light. In this case, add a "
"caption that mentions the name of the painting or the painter, or mentions "
"it's a photograph."
msgstr ""
"Seveda želimo v igri še vedno pokazati določene koncepte na fotografijah in "
"master slikah, kot je sijaj ali posredna svetloba. V tem primeru dodajte "
"napis, ki omenja ime slike ali slikarja, ali pa omenja fotografijo."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_readme.rst:319
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Photos can still be used for photobashing and the like, but only if it's "
"obviously used in the context of photobashing."
msgstr ""
"Fotografije se lahko še vedno uporabljajo za fotobarvanje in podobno, vendar "
"le, če se očitno uporabljajo v kontekstu fotobashinga."

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_readme.rst:322
