#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_readme.rst:415
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The most important one is **reviewing changes people make**. You can do this "
"on `KDE_gitlab`_ in two ways:"
msgstr ""
"Najpomembnejša je **pregled sprememb, ki jih ljudje naredijo**. To lahko "
